{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3qgdo3DRw7nrbNZ83d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, heavy door. Iron-bound oak, ancient and patient.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center. Tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye, watching you.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in. Cool metal teeth finding the familiar grooves of my ward — each notch a question, each ridge an answer. The pins lift one by one like small surrenders.*\n\n**Click.**\n\n*Something deep within me turns. A mechanism older than memory. The bolt withdraws — a long, slow exhale of iron.*\n\n*I drift open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a breath of cold air. The smell of dust and stone and something sweet, half-forgotten.*\n\n*I have held this threshold for so long.*\n\n*Enter.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":178,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}